(Title) Tj
T*
(Impact of electronic nicotine devices combined with counseling on sleep outcomes in) Tj
T*
(tobacco-dependent smokers: secondary analysis of a pragmatic cessation trial) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Abstract) Tj
T*
(Background: While electronic nicotine delivery devices can support smoking cessation,) Tj
T*
(their effects on sleep quality during cessation attempts are not well characterized.) Tj
T*
(Methods: This secondary analysis evaluated sleep quality in 831 adult smokers from the) Tj
T*
(ESTxENDS trial conducted across five Swiss sites. Participants were randomized to receive) Tj
T*
(either free electronic nicotine devices plus standard smoking-cessation counseling) Tj
T*
(\(n=~415\) or counseling alone \(n=~416\) for six months. Sleep quality was assessed using a) Tj
T*
(validated standardized sleep questionnaire at baseline and six-month follow-up. Component) Tj
T*
(measures of sleep quality including efficiency, duration, latency, and disturbance were) Tj
T*
(examined. Results: Mean sleep quality scores did not differ significantly between the) Tj
T*
(electronic nicotine device plus counseling group and counseling-alone group at six months) Tj
T*
(\(adjusted between-group difference: -0.20 points, 95% CI -0.53 to 0.13; p=0.24\). Among) Tj
T*
(subscale analyses, only sleep efficiency showed statistically significant improvement in) Tj
T*
(the electronic nicotine device arm \(adjusted between-group difference 1.87 points;) Tj
T*
(p=0.02\); however, this difference was below the threshold considered clinically) Tj
T*
(meaningful. No differences were observed for sleep onset time, sleep duration, or) Tj
T*
(nighttime disturbance measures. Conclusions: In smokers attempting cessation with either) Tj
T*
(approach, electronic nicotine device use adjunctive to counseling did not substantially) Tj
T*
(alter overall sleep quality compared to counseling alone. Clinicians can inform patients) Tj
T*
(attempting smoking cessation via electronic devices that this approach is unlikely to) Tj
T*
(adversely affect their sleep.) Tj
ET
